Architectural Analysis:This callback is the gateway to the app. Until Success is true, the API keys (Token) are invalid, and the app effectively runs in offline mode. The reference to CheckContactGroups (which is not found in the code snippets) suggests a missing routine that likely downloads the "Blacklisted" vs "Preferred" group IDs mentioned in UpdateGoogleContact.4.4.2. Subroutine: ShowUserSelectionSource Artifact: Copy) m4XMainPage.bas VB.NetSub ShowUserSelection
    Dim options As List
